# seq_clear while playing: the track finishes its pass and is removed
# at its boundary; a waiting version is dropped too. Submitting after
# the clear (before the boundary) cancels the clear. A track waiting
# for its start beat is removed at once. Restart applies pending
# clears.
open virtual
track 1 60:2 62:2
track 2:2 72:4
play continue
runto 1
clear 1
track 2 74:4
clear 2
state
runto 5
log
state
track 1 60:2
runto 6.5
clear 1
track 1 65:1
runto 9
log
runto 9.5
track 3:3 76:1
clear 3
state
clear 1
play restart
runto 1
log
state
